    "chunk_text": "Gayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/2/2016/CEB/93.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u2018Mihikatha Medura\u2019,No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.25th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 612\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\n2AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'03PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.07.2019\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nAn allotment of land in total extent of about 0.0191 hectare depitedin the Advance Tracing No. CO/KLN/2016/623 dated 26.05.2017prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village calledUdumulla, in the Grama Niladhari Division of Udumulla South, inthe Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kolonnawa of ColomboDistrict in Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Millagahawatta \u2013 Extent: 0.0191 HectareNorth: Road and Millagahawatta claimed by H. G. Ashoka Kaldera;East and South: Millagahawatta claimed by H. G. Ashoka Kaldera\n\nand Millagahawatta in which ownership cannot be found; West:Road.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/2/2016/CEB/94.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u2018Mihikatha Medura\u2019,No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.25th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 613"
