    "chunk_text": "wxl 2130$40 - 2019 cQ,s ui 04 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'07'04No. 2130/40 \u2013 THURSDAY, JULY 04, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref.No.: 5/3/4/1821.Ministry of Land and Parliamentary Reforms ReferenceNo.: 4-3/7/2016/HW/423.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following land/Servitude which isrequired for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotments of Land, containing in extent of 9.7736Hectares, Lots 46-97 (51 lots) under mentioned land shown inthe Surveyor General\u2019s Cadastral Map No. 310036 dated on31.05.2019, Block No.03, Sheet No.3, situated in the village ofNiggollayaya in the Grama Niladhari Division of Wawulambe(E 440 C), in Dambulla Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in MataleDistrict of Central Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 46Name of the Land: Ruwanmadugalakele; Description ofLand: Open waste land; Claimant: Government; OriginalClaimant: Rangiri Dambulla Rajamaha Viharaya. Possessedby Ravindra Jayalath Fernando resident in No. 109, Kiriyala,Handapangoda; Extent: 0.0320 Hectare.\n\n1A - PG 4583 - 87 (2019/07)\n\n2. Lot No. 47Name of the Land: Ruwanmadugalakele, Kapuyaya;Description of Land: Garden; Claimant: Government; OriginalClaimant: Rangiri Dambulla Rajamaha Viharaya. Possessedby Aluthgedara Sriyananda resident in Niggollayaya,Ethabendiwewa; Extent: 0.2032 Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 48Name of the Land: -; Description of Land: Road; Claimant:Government; Extent: 0.1143 Hectare."
