    "chunk_text": "IV ^w& fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'04PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF S RI LANKA \u2013 04.07.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nw;s \u00fafYIThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) \u2013 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nAppointments & C., By the Governors\n\nwxl 2130$44 \u2013 2019 cQ,s ui 04 jeks n%yiam;skaod \u2013 2019'07'04No. 2130/44 \u2013 THURSDAY, JULY 04, 2019\n\nUVA PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nAppointment made by the Governor\n\nMy No. : 01/10/03/04.\n\nIT is hereby announce that the following appointment has been made by Hon. Presidents Counsel Marshall Perera, Governorof Uva Province under the section 33 (1) of the Provincial Council Act, No. 42 of 1987 of the Democratic Socialist Republic ofSri Lanka.\n\nName and AddressPostPeriod\n\nMr. W. M. Senevirathna Weerasinghe (AAL)Member of the Uva Provincialsince 01.04.2019No. 225, Temple Road, Navulla, Demodara.Council Public Service Commissionfor one year period\n\nR. M. T. B. HATHIYALDENIYA,Secretary to the Governor of Uva Province.\n\nOffice of the Uva Governor,Badulla.02nd July, 2019.\n\n07 - 646/1\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 PG4585 \u2013 32 (07/2019)\n\n2AIV ^w& fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'04PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF S RI LANKA \u2013 04.07.2019\n\nMy No. : 01/10/03/04.UVA PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nAppointment made by the Governor\n\nBY virtue of powers vested to me under section 154F. Sub Section (5) of the 13th Amendment to the Constitution of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, President\u2019s Counsel Marshall Perera, Governor of Uva Province, do herebyannounce that I have made the following appointment.\n\nHon. Anura Raveendra Vidanagamage\n\nMinister of Health, Indigenous Medicine, Probation & ChildCare, Women Affairs and Social Welfare of Uva Province."
