    "chunk_size_bytes": 1579,
    "chunk_text": "BY virtue of powers vested to me under section 154F. Sub Section (5) of the 13th Amendment to the Constitution of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, President\u2019s Counsel Marshall Perera, Governor of Uva Province, do herebyannounce that I have made the following appointment.\n\nHon. Anura Raveendra Vidanagamage\n\nMinister of Health, Indigenous Medicine, Probation & ChildCare, Women Affairs and Social Welfare of Uva Province.\n\nOffice of the Governor - Uva,02nd July, 2019.\n\n07 - 646/2\n\nMy No. : 01/10/03/04.\n\nUVA PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nAppointment made by the Governor\n\nIT is hereby announce that the following appointment has been made by Hon. Ariya B. Rekawa, Governor of Uva Provinceunder the section 33 (1) of the Provincial Council Act, No. 42 of 1987 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\n\nName and AddressPostAppointment Date\n\nMr. Rajarathnam Gnanasekeran,Member of the Uva ProvincialSince 12.10.2018\n\nP. O. Box 02, Koswaththa Waththa, Haldummulla.Council Public Service Commissionfor one year period\n\nR. M. T. B. HATHIYALDENIYA,Secretary to the Governor of Uva Province\n\nOffice of the Uva Governor,Badulla.02nd July, 2019.\n\n07 - 646/3\n\nAs Acting Minister of Road Development, Housing, WaterSupply, Estate Infrastructure and Co-operative affairs, TamilEducation (Except Muslim Schools) of Uva Province, from thedate 28th June, 2019 till the return to Sri Lanka of subjectMinister Hon. Akalan Sendil Thondaman Mutthuvinayagamwho is abroad from 28th June, 2019 to 05th July 2019.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA"
