    "chunk_text": "2AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'05PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 05.07.2019\n\nMy No. : IR/COM/04/2017/139\n\nMr. L. P. Jayasundara,No. 14/3, Isurupura,Kesbewa,Piliyandala.\n\nand\n\nSri Lanka Land Reclamation and Development Corporation,No. 03, Sri Jayawardenapura Mawatha,Welikada,Rajagiriya.\n\nStatement of matter in disputeThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is\n\nWhether Mr. L. P. Jayasundara who had worked in the SriLanka Land Reclamation and Development Corporation hadbeen caused injustice by,\n\n1. Not been paid arrears of salary from 07.10.1993 to06.05.1996 relevant to the post of special GradeClerks, to which he was appointed with effect from07.10.1993.\n\n2. Not been paid an allowance for the loan collectionduties carried out in addition to the duties assignedto him.\n\n3. The salary revision not been carried out propertywhen he was promoted to the post of SeniorAdministration Officer from 01.01.2016.\n\n4. Not been appointed to the post of Manager(Admminstration) of the Equipment Division eventhough he had carried out duties of the post from20.10.2014.\n\nand if so, to what reliefs he is entitled.\n\nDated at the office of the Commissioner General of LabourColombo this 24th day of June, 2019.\n\nA. WIMALAWEERA,Commissioner General of Labour.\n\n07 - 683\n\nMy No. IR/COM/01/2017/151\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OFCEYLON (1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS an industrial dispute in respect of the matterspecified in the statement of the Commissioner of Labourwhich accompanies this Order exists between.\n\nMr. K. H. Rayman Sujeewa,No. 3586, Galwewa Junction,Suriyawewa.\n\nand\n\nChina Harbour Engineering Company Limited,100, Feet Road,Mirijjawila,Hambantota."
